{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EwykJN1vamc6F1rauoA71k","type":"tool_result","content":"15\t---\n16\t\n17\t## The Job\n18\t\n19\t1. Read the **current ralph story** from `scripts/ralph/prd.json` (the story whose `id` matches `RALPH_TASK_ID`, or the highest-priority `passes: false` story otherwise — same rule as `scripts/ralph/CLAUDE.md`).\n20\t2. Read **course context**: `/courses/<slug>/research.md`, `/courses/<slug>/sources.md` (if present), and `/courses/<slug>/course.json`.\n21\t3. Read the **per-widget JSON Schemas** under `src/widgets/schemas/` (`theory.json`, `quiz.json`, `code.json`, `demo.json`, `sandbox.json`).\n22\t4. **Source research pass** — identify ≥ 3 credible references for this lesson *before writing content*. Prefer stable URLs (DOI, arxiv, official docs, Wikipedia for foundational concepts, official YouTube channels). See Step 4 for the full rules.\n23\t5. Compose a lesson with **4–8 sections** mixing widget types (rules below).\n24\t6. Write `/courses/<slug>/lessons/<lesson-slug>.json` — including the `sources` field (lesson-level) plus optional `section.sources` for theory sections that draw on a specific reference.\n25\t7. Validate the file against `LessonSchema` (`src/lib/schemas/lesson.ts`). On failure, read the Zod issues, fix the JSON, retry. Never commit invalid JSON.\n26\t8. Stop. The skill ends after the lesson file is written and validates.\n27\t\n28\t---\n29\t\n30\t## Step 1: Read the Story\n31\t\n32\tThe story lives in `scripts/ralph/prd.json` and looks like this (produced by `init_course`):\n33\t\n34\t```json\n35\t{\n36\t  \"id\": \"US-005\",\n37\t  \"title\": \"Generate lesson: Median filter\",\n38\t  \"description\": \"As an agent, I want a complete lesson JSON for Median filter at /courses/image-denoising/lessons/median-filter.json, so the webapp can render it.\",\n39\t  \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n40\t    \"Lesson JSON validates against LessonSchema\",\n41\t    \"Uses ≥3 widget types where the topic permits\",\n42\t    \"Uses generate_lesson skill\",\n43\t    \"Typecheck passes\"\n44\t  ],"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a5179973-6d3e-41c1-821c-3b55ae720415","uuid":"1ff4dd17-9b92-4759-9d5c-f73bf2160938","timestamp":"2026-05-04T00:53:28.078Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/nukeemann/projects/ai_lecturer/.worktrees/US-051/scripts/ralph/skills/generate_lesson/SKILL.md","content":"---\n\n## The Job\n\n1. Read the **current ralph story** from `scripts/ralph/prd.json` (the story whose `id` matches `RALPH_TASK_ID`, or the highest-priority `passes: false` story otherwise — same rule as `scripts/ralph/CLAUDE.md`).\n2. Read **course context**: `/courses/<slug>/research.md`, `/courses/<slug>/sources.md` (if present), and `/courses/<slug>/course.json`.\n3. Read the **per-widget JSON Schemas** under `src/widgets/schemas/` (`theory.json`, `quiz.json`, `code.json`, `demo.json`, `sandbox.json`).\n4. **Source research pass** — identify ≥ 3 credible references for this lesson *before writing content*. Prefer stable URLs (DOI, arxiv, official docs, Wikipedia for foundational concepts, official YouTube channels). See Step 4 for the full rules.\n5. Compose a lesson with **4–8 sections** mixing widget types (rules below).\n6. Write `/courses/<slug>/lessons/<lesson-slug>.json` — including the `sources` field (lesson-level) plus optional `section.sources` for theory sections that draw on a specific reference.\n7. Validate the file against `LessonSchema` (`src/lib/schemas/lesson.ts`). On failure, read the Zod issues, fix the JSON, retry. Never commit invalid JSON.\n8. Stop. The skill ends after the lesson file is written and validates.\n\n---\n\n## Step 1: Read the Story\n\nThe story lives in `scripts/ralph/prd.json` and looks like this (produced by `init_course`):\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"US-005\",\n  \"title\": \"Generate lesson: Median filter\",\n  \"description\": \"As an agent, I want a complete lesson JSON for Median filter at /courses/image-denoising/lessons/median-filter.json, so the webapp can render it.\",\n  \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n    \"Lesson JSON validates against LessonSchema\",\n    \"Uses ≥3 widget types where the topic permits\",\n    \"Uses generate_lesson skill\",\n    \"Typecheck passes\"\n  ],","numLines":30,"startLine":15,"totalLines":462}}}
